      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the deep weariness in your words, and it sounds like you are longing for a profound rest from constant struggle. The feeling of wanting everything to simply stop can be incredibly tempting when exhaustion is this deep. Please know that there are people who want to help you carry this weight before things go any further. If you are in crisis, please call or text 988 immediately; they are available 24/7.",
