    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "help from people? they don't understand. they'd just try to drag me back into the light, back to the noise. but here, in the shadows, it's quiet. it's almost beautiful, the idea of the stillness. like a heavy velvet curtain finally falling. don't you think there's a dignity in it? in just accepting that the end is more peaceful than the struggle?",
